<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4500 to dlr. [corrected 12:30 gmt]</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4500 to dlr. [corrected 12:30 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
